{"sha": "78866d240b7e896d3c9d4cdc82d5437e8cfd3db882df282020df0f3e35ffbd2d", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:euclid:10}", "设 $y \\in \\ker(u - \\mathrm{id})$（即 $u(y) = y$），且 $x \\in E$。", "于是利用内积的保持性（$\\langle u(a),", "u(b)\\rangle = \\langle a, b\\rangle$）：", "\\[", "\\langle x - u(x),\\, y\\rangle", "= \\langle x, y\\rangle - \\langle u(x), y\\rangle", "= \\langle x, y\\rangle - \\langle u(x), u(y)\\rangle", "= \\langle x, y\\rangle - \\langle x, y\\rangle = 0 :", "\\]", "这说明 $\\operatorname{im}(u - \\mathrm{id})$ 中的每个向量都与", "每个不动向量正交。", "", "因此 $\\operatorname{im}(u - \\mathrm{id}) \\subseteq \\ker(u -", "\\mathrm{id})^{\\perp}$。由秩--零度定理及", "\\cref{exo:b1:euclid:7}，二者维数均为 $\\dim E - \\dim\\ker(u -", "\\mathrm{id})$，因此二者相等。于是 $E = \\ker(u - \\mathrm{id})", "\\oplus \\ker(u - \\mathrm{id})^\\perp = \\ker(u - \\mathrm{id}) \\oplus", "\\operatorname{im}(u - \\mathrm{id})$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:euclid:11}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 设 $Gc = 0$，其中列向量 $c = (c_1, \\dots,", "        c_k)^{\\mathsf T}$。则", "        \\[", "        \\Bigl\\lVert\\sum_i c_i v_i\\Bigr\\rVert^2", "        = \\sum_{i,j} c_i c_j \\langle v_i, v_j\\rangle", "        = c^{\\mathsf T} G\\, c = 0,", "        \\]", "        于是 $\\sum_i c_i v_i = 0$。若该族线性无关，则", "        必有 $c = 0$，即 $G$ 可逆。反之，", "        若存在非平凡关系 $\\sum_j c_j v_j = 0$，则分别与各 $v_i$ 作内积，", "        得非平凡关系", "        $Gc = 0$，故 $G$ 奇异。线性无关 $\\iff \\det G \\neq 0$。", "  \\item $\\langle X^{i-1}, X^{j-1}\\rangle = \\int_0^1 x^{i+j-2}\\dd", "        x = \\frac{1}{i+j-1}$：$(1, X, X^2)$ 的格拉姆矩阵", "        恰为希尔伯特矩阵 $H_3$，其行列式", "        $\\frac1{2160}$ 由\\cref{ch:b1:det}的周末问题算出：", "        非零，故单项式线性无关 ---", "        与预期相符，但现在由一个数值加以证实。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:euclid:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $A^2 = A A = A^{\\mathsf T} A = I$，故 $u^2 =", "        \\mathrm{id}$：$u$ 是对称，且", "        由\\cref{thm:b1:linmaps:projchar}~(2)可得 $E = \\ker(u -", "        \\mathrm{id}) \\oplus \\ker(u + \\mathrm{id})$。", "  \\item 设 $u(x) = x$，$u(y) = -y$。由于 $u$ 保持", "        内积，", "        \\[", "        \\langle x, y\\rangle = \\langle u(x), u(y)\\rangle", "        = \\langle x, -y\\rangle = -\\langle x, y\\rangle ,", "        \\]", "        故 $\\langle x, y\\rangle = 0$，两个特征子空间", "        正交，$\\ker(u + \\mathrm{id}) = F^\\perp$，其中 $F =", "        \\ker(u - \\mathrm{id})$，且 $u$ 是", "        关于 $F$ 的正交对称。", "  \\item $R_\\theta$ 对称当且仅当 $-\\sin\\theta = \\sin\\theta$，", "        即 $\\theta \\in \\{0, \\pi\\}$：映射 $\\pm\\mathrm{id}$", "        （恒等映射与中心对称）。每个 $S_\\theta$ 都是", "        对称，即关于直线的对称。这些恰为", "        平面上的正交对称，$F$ 分别取", "        整个平面、$\\{0\\}$ 或反射轴。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:euclid:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\norm{t_a(x) - t_a(y)} = \\norm{x - y}$；线性等距变换", "保持范数，从而保持距离（$\\norm{g(x) - g(y)} =", "\\norm{g(x - y)} = \\norm{x-y}$）；保距映射的复合仍保持距离。", "每个等距变换都是单射（不同点之间保持正距离），并", "由下面的分类知它为双射；恒等映射与", "逆映射均为等距变换，", "从而构成一个群。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\norm{f(x)} = \\norm{f(x) - f(0)} = \\norm{x - 0} =", "\\norm x$。由极化恒等式：", "\\[", "\\langle f(x), f(y)\\rangle", "= \\frac{\\norm{f(x)}^2 + \\norm{f(y)}^2 - \\norm{f(x) -", "f(y)}^2}{2}", "= \\frac{\\norm x^2 + \\norm y^2 - \\norm{x - y}^2}{2}", "= \\langle x, y\\rangle .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{3.} 利用第 2 小题展开（$f$ 的每个乘积", "等于其自变量的乘积）：", "\\begin{align*}", "\\norm{f(x+y) - f(x) - f(y)}^2", "&= \\norm{x+y}^2 + \\norm x^2 + \\norm y^2\\\\", "&\\quad - 2\\langle x+y, x\\rangle - 2\\langle x+y, y\\rangle", "+ 2\\langle x, y\\rangle = 0 ,", "\\end{align*}", "直接验算可知上式为零；类似地，$\\norm{f(\\lambda x) -", "\\lambda f(x)}^2 = \\norm{\\lambda x}^2 - 2\\lambda\\langle \\lambda", "x, x\\rangle + \\lambda^2\\norm x^2 = 0$。于是 $f(x + y) = f(x) +", "f(y)$，$f(\\lambda x) = \\lambda f(x)$，故 $f$ 线性，且", "保持范数，即 $f \\in O(\\R^2)$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 令 $a = f(0)$，$g = t_{-a}\\circ f$，它是固定", "$0$ 的等距变换，由第 3 小题知为线性等距变换，且 $f = t_a", "\\circ g$。唯一性：由 $t_a \\circ g = t_{a'}\\circ g'$ 在", "$0$ 处取值得 $a = a'$，进而 $g = g'$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $(t_a\\circ g)\\circ(t_{a'}\\circ g') = t_{a +", "g(a')}\\circ(g\\circ g')$，因为 $g\\,t_{a'} = t_{g(a')}\\,g$ 对", "线性映射 $g$ 成立。于是复合的线性部分为 $g \\circ g'$，", "且 $\\det(gg') = \\det g \\det g'$，于是", "保向 $\\circ$ 保向 $=$ 反向 $\\circ$ 反向 $=$ 保向，", "保向 $\\circ$ 反向 $=$ 反向 --- 即 $\\pm1$ 的符号法则。", ""]}